.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt EVP_MD-RIPEMD160 7ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm EVP_MD-RIPEMD160
.Nd The RIPEMD160 EVP_MD implementation
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Support for computing RIPEMD160 digests through the
.Sy EVP_MD
API.
.Ss Identities
This implementation is available in both the default and legacy
providers, and is identified with any of the names "RIPEMD-160",
"RIPEMD160", "RIPEMD" and "RMD160".
.Ss Gettable Parameters
This implementation supports the common gettable parameters described in
.Xr EVP_MD-common 7 .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr provider-digest 7 ,
.Xr OSSL_PROVIDER-default 7
.Sh HISTORY
This digest was added to the default provider in OpenSSL 3.0.7.
